  "description": "WINXUQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H80 F9 N18 O18 Tb4 3+,C4 H14 N3 1+,4(C2 F3 O2 1-),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.806-3.915 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.92-111.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4(OH)4(tfa)3(deta)4(detadcH)2](tfa)4(detaH)(H2O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
